==============================================================================
Code ported from rvt-rs
==============================================================================

Parts of BIMCraft's reader are ported from rvt-rs, an open reader for Autodesk
Revit files, https://github.com/DrunkOnJava/rvt-rs, which carries this notice:

    rvt-rs: open reader for Autodesk Revit files
    Copyright 2026 Griffin Long

    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The version BIMCraft ported from is commit
b6086d41b9758fd9b92f42f0a47b8345b9c58056 (after the v0.6.1 tag). What was taken,
and from which file, is listed module by module in BIMCraft's
docs/rvt-provenance.md.

==============================================================================
Changes made in MiniBIM
==============================================================================

Every file in this directory was rewritten from BIMCraft's Rust into C++ for
MiniBIM: it opens with a line naming the BIMCraft source file and commit and
stating that it was rewritten. The Compound File and deflate readers that
BIMCraft takes from the cfb and flate2 crates are written here from the public
specifications (MS-CFB, RFC 1951, RFC 1952).

